  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that pca_n2000 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion (config_006) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests whether switching to scvi_n200 RNA encoder and avgpool aggregation while keeping resnet50 image encoder and weighted fusion reduces performance, isolating the impact of RNA encoder and aggregation choices. It balances exploitation of strong performers with exploration of critical design factors."
